<div style="max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 20px;">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;">

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">⭐</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>What is the Loyalty Program?</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">The Nichey Loyalty Program rewards you every time you shop. Earn points on every purchase and redeem them for discounts on future orders.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">💰</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>How to Earn Points</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Every AED 1 you spend earns 1 Loyalty Point. Simply sign in to your account before checkout and points will be added automatically after each purchase.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">🎁</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>How to Redeem Points</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">At checkout, you can choose to redeem your available points for a discount on your order. Points are applied automatically when you are signed in.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">🏆</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Loyalty Tiers</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">The more you shop, the higher your tier. Bronze, Silver, and Gold members enjoy exclusive benefits including bonus points, early access to sales, and special birthday rewards.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">📅</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Points Expiry</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Loyalty points are valid for 12 months from the date they are earned. Make sure to use them before they expire to get the most out of your rewards.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">👤</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>How to Join</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Simply create a free Nichey account to automatically join the Loyalty Program. If you already have an account, you're already a member — just sign in and start earning.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">📧</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Questions?</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">For any questions about your points or rewards, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@nichey.store" style="color:#1a1a1a;">hello@nichey.store</a> and our team will be happy to help.</span></div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

